      "name": "ck-moe-blockscale-mfma32-remap-cshuffle",
      "description": "On CK fp8 block-scale grouped-MoE GEMM (gfx950), remap the pipeline to MFMA 32x32 + CShuffle epilogue: ~1.47x isolated, biggest on large cases",
